(5738, 0, 7, 'Er... that''s how I found them.  I wanted to show the king that they were a threat!  Say Captain... I overheard Guard Fengus calling you a fat, useless gnoll lover!', 9423, 1, 1, 0, 0, 5, 0, 0, '', 0, 0),
(15010, 0, 0, 'Come again.', 11052, 1, 1, 15011, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(15011, 0, 0, 'Ok, let me get this straight. You put the scepter shard entrusted to your Flight by Anachronos on a minnow of your own making and now you expect me to build an... an arcanite buoy or something... to force your minnow out of hiding? AND potentially incur the wrath of an Elemental Lord? Did I miss anything? Perhaps I am to do this without any clothes on, during a solar eclipse, on a leap year?
